1.Create a function to calculate price_range(low, medium, high) of each product. If price<=5
indicate as low, upto 50 indicate as medium, and above as high.


mysql> create function pra_range(price decimal(10,2)) returns varchar(10) deterministic begin declare result varchar (10); if price <=1020 then set result ='low'; elseif price <=23000 then  set result ='medium'; else set result = 'high'; end if; return result; end$$
Query OK, 0 rows affected (0.18 sec)

mysql> select pname,price,pra_range(price) as price_category from product ;$$
